{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日朝 宅配便の\nピンポーンの音で目が覚めてね\n急いで起きて\nインターホンの電話取ったら..."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もう居なかったヽ(；▽；)ノ\nいやぁぁぁー。\n化粧水と乳液頼んでたのに"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"早いよー宅急便さん。\nだから今日はめっちゃ\nケチって使いました。\nちょこーっとだけね。\n明日にはまた届くかなぁー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお仕事帰りに\nそのまま まりかとあみと\n買い物行ってご飯食べた！\n久しぶりの中華料理"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は新宿だったけど\n次は原宿に行きたいなぁ～。\n買い物は 洋服は新宿が多いけど\n原宿でもたまに買います(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はラビリンスで\n何着か買いました♪♪\n春物なので\n暖かくなったら貼ります。\nウキウキッッ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今はホテルで\nまりかと相部屋です！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いや、違うのよ。\n本当は一人だったんだけど\nまりかがついてきたの(￣ー￣)\n怖いよ～みさぁ～って。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから仕方なく\n一緒になったよ♡笑\nまぁそれが可愛いんだけどさ。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"まりっ会のみなさま\nまりかをいただきまりっか。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"～質問返し～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"博多通りもんってお菓子知ってますか？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"知っちょんし食べたことも\n何回もあるよ～♡\n\"通りもんば食べんね？\nうまか～！\n傑作饅頭～博多通りもん♪♪ \""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさみさはこないだ20歳になったけど、お酒は強い方？弱い方？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わからんけど\nお母さんもお父さんも\n兄ちゃんも家族みんな強いから\nたぶん強いんかな？\n九州女♡´･ᴗ･`♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"髪の毛のトリートメントとか何かしてる？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"２日に１回、これを使ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"行きつけの美容院のもので\nみさの髪はこの子のおかげで\nなんとか頑張ってます！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"久しぶりの私服っっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0004.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"では、おやすみさみさ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0005.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"明日は日曜日！\nみんな何するの？(*^^*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/misa.eto/img/2013/02/03/1720471/0006.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"前髪分けて見た♡´･ᴗ･`♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"good night !!"}],"source":"archive"}